WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.180
Imagine a factory for difficult problems.

00:00:02.840 --> 00:00:04.940
The useful part isn't asking an agent for

00:00:04.940 --> 00:00:05.420
an answer.

00:00:05.940 --> 00:00:07.760
It's knowing exactly what must be true

00:00:07.760 --> 00:00:09.460
before any answer earns trust.

00:00:10.100 --> 00:00:12.040
The hanger begins with 100 bounded

00:00:12.040 --> 00:00:14.000
workbenches across nine domains.

00:00:14.720 --> 00:00:16.700
Every station starts with an external

00:00:16.700 --> 00:00:19.640
truth condition, a reference benchmark, a

00:00:19.640 --> 00:00:22.180
hard passgate, and an economic or physical

00:00:22.180 --> 00:00:22.720
guardrail.

00:00:23.640 --> 00:00:25.260
Pick a problem by what can be measured,

00:00:25.740 --> 00:00:27.840
not by how exciting a claim sounds.

00:00:27.840 --> 00:00:31.140
Here we open workbench 001, general

00:00:31.140 --> 00:00:32.620
purpose lossless compression.

00:00:33.320 --> 00:00:36.440
Its job is precise, reconstruct every file

00:00:36.440 --> 00:00:37.540
identically.

00:00:37.980 --> 00:00:39.980
Measure compressed bytes, speed, memory,

00:00:39.980 --> 00:00:40.580
and energy.

00:00:41.160 --> 00:00:43.040
Then compare the result against pinned

00:00:43.040 --> 00:00:43.840
reference tools.

00:00:44.480 --> 00:00:46.420
A clever idea that cannot clear those

00:00:46.420 --> 00:00:48.180
gates stays a recorded attempt.

00:00:48.880 --> 00:00:50.460
The shift board is where the factory

00:00:50.460 --> 00:00:52.240
itself is built and tested.

00:00:52.830 --> 00:00:55.400
An operator creates a construction or

00:00:55.400 --> 00:00:58.040
synthetic commissioning order, defines the

00:00:58.040 --> 00:00:59.980
bounded task and its done condition and

00:00:59.980 --> 00:01:01.760
claims it under their own identity.

00:01:02.600 --> 00:01:04.700
The order can move only through explicit

00:01:04.700 --> 00:01:07.700
revision checked commands, open claimed in

00:01:07.700 --> 00:01:10.200
progress review then completed, or blocked

00:01:10.200 --> 00:01:10.840
with a reason.

00:01:11.740 --> 00:01:13.280
Runner interfaces are registered

00:01:13.280 --> 00:01:13.800
separately.

00:01:14.380 --> 00:01:16.320
Each runner states what it is allowed to

00:01:16.320 --> 00:01:18.340
execute and the trust assumptions around

00:01:18.340 --> 00:01:18.880
it.

00:01:19.140 --> 00:01:21.360
In this first -hanger, runners are

00:01:21.360 --> 00:01:22.220
commissioning only.

00:01:22.880 --> 00:01:24.780
They cannot upload arbitrary code,

00:01:25.020 --> 00:01:27.400
dispatch live research, or mark themselves

00:01:27.400 --> 00:01:28.360
promotion grade.

00:01:28.940 --> 00:01:31.240
Every change creates a new appendonely

00:01:31.240 --> 00:01:32.100
history event.

00:01:33.020 --> 00:01:34.740
Corrections never erase earlier work.

00:01:35.340 --> 00:01:37.580
A failed attempt, a blocked route, or a

00:01:37.580 --> 00:01:40.060
disagreement remains searchable, so future

00:01:40.060 --> 00:01:42.280
people and agents don't pay to explore the

00:01:42.280 --> 00:01:44.220
same dead end without knowing it.

00:01:44.540 --> 00:01:46.840
And here is the most important guardrail.

00:01:47.400 --> 00:01:49.720
Completing a synthetic work order proves

00:01:49.720 --> 00:01:51.720
only that the factory plumbing worked.

00:01:52.500 --> 00:01:54.960
It is not scientific evidence, it is not

00:01:54.960 --> 00:01:56.240
an independent reproduction.

00:01:56.900 --> 00:01:58.240
It cannot promote a result.

00:01:58.840 --> 00:02:00.600
The scientific control plane is

00:02:00.600 --> 00:02:01.560
deliberately separate.

00:02:02.300 --> 00:02:04.300
When that lane is built, a claim can begin

00:02:04.300 --> 00:02:06.460
blind validation by two different people

00:02:06.460 --> 00:02:08.620
and their agents starting from zero

00:02:08.620 --> 00:02:10.420
evidence and zero reproductions.

00:02:11.280 --> 00:02:12.880
The hanger may propose a handoff.

00:02:13.480 --> 00:02:15.200
It cannot approve its own science.

00:02:15.790 --> 00:02:16.940
That is the workflow.

00:02:17.600 --> 00:02:19.380
Bound the problem, define the gates,

00:02:19.700 --> 00:02:21.560
attribute the work, constrain the runner,

00:02:21.980 --> 00:02:24.000
preserve every attempt, and keep promotion

00:02:24.000 --> 00:02:25.900
outside the system that produced the

00:02:25.900 --> 00:02:26.240
claim.

00:02:27.040 --> 00:02:29.020
The factory doesn't promise instant

00:02:29.020 --> 00:02:30.100
breakthroughs.

00:02:30.100 --> 00:02:32.520
It makes genuine progress legible,

00:02:32.660 --> 00:02:34.360
repeatable, and harder to fake.
